          {
            "criterion": "Process boundary gate passes",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/mydev/bbx-gate-repairs/target/fixture-handoff/boundaries.log:67"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "A real panic with ctl unavailable leaves no process with the private HOME",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/mydev/bbx-gate-repairs/target/fixture-handoff/private-app-final.log:5"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Shared daemon group and unrelated-owner control",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/mydev/bbx-gate-repairs/target/fixture-handoff/shared-codex-cleanup.log:6"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Paused fake Cargo exits on fixture closure and broken worker-group control still fails as intended",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/mydev/bbx-gate-repairs/target/fixture-handoff/landing-cleanup.log:16"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
    ```

    ## Oracle amendment, 2026-11-21 19:50: land the leak fix on its own now
    - The report names `3dc592c78` but it is **not on origin/main** (local in `/Users/feral/mydev/bbx-gate-repairs`, under `8a0d6423b` for the flakes task). A report is accepted only once its commit is on main.
    - **Do:** land `3dc592c78` alone first: `git switch -c leak-land 3dc592c78`, rebase onto origin/main, `make land` (detached, one gate machine-wide), then return to `exec/gate-repairs`, rebase `8a0d6423b` on the new main and continue the flakes task (the leak fix may remove one flake; measure before changing more).
    - Then `task_report` again with the landed SHA and `make test-boundaries` as `verify_result.command`.


    ## Report from seat:01M7ZVK9YFPRSBR7EJF6DPC5E1

    [[Verified]] The leak-only commit 42dac19c3 landed on origin/main, with 203 integration tests and all 39 exact-source boundary tests passing. Both Dream Read cases passed through their existing registration. The change removes frontend-only cleanup, duplicated raw PID fallbacks and indefinite fake Cargo pauses.

